These licenses do not grant you any other rights, for example under the licensor's trademark, or to the software as the licensor would make it available under other terms.

## Extra Right to Clean Reimplementations

You may duplicate the functionality of the software by writing entirely new code, so long as you do not copy code, try to recreate the code by reading the code, or reverse engineer the software.

## Defensive Termination

If you make any charge of patent infringement against the licensor or anyone else for using the software, your license to the software ends immediately.

